{"id":2244,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2244"},"modified":"2025-10-02T10:30:41","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T10:30:41","slug":"cardboard-boxes-with-lid","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-lid\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Boxes With Lid"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Durable Cardboard Boxes with Lid for Every Need<\/h2>\n<p>We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong><em>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/strong><\/a> offer durable, high-quality <strong>cardboard boxes with lid<\/strong> for a wide range of storage, shipping, and packaging needs. Whether you need compact boxes for organizing small items or <strong>large cardboard boxes with lid<\/strong> for shipping bulky products, we can provide the exact size, style, and structure you\u2019re looking for.<\/p>\n<p>Our boxes are available in custom sizes and finishes, and can be designed to suit various industries\u2014from retail and storage to gifting and apparel. You can choose between fully plain or printed surfaces and request secure-fitting removable or hinged lids based on your preferences.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Durable and Easy-To-Use Lid Boxes for Storage and Presentation<\/h2>\n<h3>Designed for Security and Organization<\/h3>\n<p>Boxes with lids provide a clean and practical solution for everyday packaging. They are especially useful when the contents need added coverage or presentation value.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Keeps items protected from dust, moisture, and light<\/li>\n<li>Suitable for both shipping and on-shelf display<\/li>\n<li>Stackable and reusable<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>From gift kits and archive storage to retail packaging and product launches, <strong>cardboard boxes with lid bulk<\/strong> help brands manage packaging efficiently while keeping items secure.<\/p>\n<h3>Great for Retail and Gifting Use<\/h3>\n<p>These boxes are often used in stores and events for packaging items that require easy access. The lid provides structure while offering a neat unboxing experience.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Great for shoes, apparel, books, and accessories<\/li>\n<li>Ideal for <strong>cardboard storage boxes for clothes<\/strong> in inventory rooms<\/li>\n<li>Used for handmade products and branded welcome kits<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>You can also request <strong>cardboard boxes with lids decorative<\/strong> for more festive or retail-ready applications.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table style=\"height: 379px;\" width=\"906\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Sizes<\/td>\n<td>All Custom Sizes \u2013 From small to large (length x width x height)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lid Styles<\/td>\n<td>Removable Lids, Magnetic Closure, Two-Piece Lid &amp; Base<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Options<\/td>\n<td>Kraft, White SBS, Corrugated E-flute, Bux Board<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Inside and Outside Printing Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Options<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finishing Options<\/td>\n<td>Foil Stamping, Embossing, Die-Cut Windows, Handle Options<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Food-Safe Option<\/td>\n<td>FDA-Compliant Coating Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quantity Range<\/td>\n<td>Low MOQ Starting at 100 \u2013 Up to 500,000+<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sample Formats<\/td>\n<td>Flat View, 3D Mock-up, Physical Sample Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days Standard; Rush Delivery Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Support<\/td>\n<td>Free Artwork Help, Layout Review, File Optimization<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Boxes With Lids for Storage and Bulk Use<\/h2>\n<h3>Ideal for Long-Term and Daily Storage<\/h3>\n<p>Many businesses and households use cardboard boxes with lids for storage to organize inventory, archive paperwork, or manage seasonal items. Whether you&#8217;re storing retail items, shipping merchandise, or packing personal goods, <strong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"458\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-window\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"456\">Cardboard Boxes With Window<\/a><\/strong> keep contents neat and contained.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Used for warehouse and office organization<\/li>\n<li>Preferred for ecommerce brands storing order-ready goods<\/li>\n<li>Great for gift set assembly and promotional packaging<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>They\u2019re also a smart choice for <strong>bulk boxes with lids<\/strong> when shipping multiple products together or offering limited-edition product bundles.<\/p>\n<h3>Sizes That Fit All Needs<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re looking for a <strong>small box with lid cardboard<\/strong> option or a large one, our production is flexible enough to handle both ends of the spectrum.<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Small: Ideal for jewelry, samples, cosmetics<\/li>\n<li>Medium: Books, gifts, clothing, beauty kits<\/li>\n<li>Large: Shoes, textiles, large accessories<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>We also manufacture <strong>cardboard box with removable lid<\/strong> styles that are reusable and easy to open, making them perfect for branding and gifting.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Coating, Finishing, and Printing Customization<\/h2>\n<h3>Add the Final Touch to Your Packaging<\/h3>\n<p>Coating options allow you to improve both the appearance and durability of your box. Based on your brand style or usage scenario, you can select from:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gloss: Adds shine and color depth<\/li>\n<li>Matte: Smooth, glare-free surface<\/li>\n<li>Spot UV: Highlights specific artwork or text areas<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>These coatings not only protect the surface but also improve the feel of the box in hand.<\/p>\n<h3>Branding That Matches Your Identity<\/h3>\n<p>Our printing services give you full creative control. You can go minimal with single-color branding or add full-panel, high-resolution artwork across the lid and base.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add logos, messages, and QR codes<\/li>\n<li>Inside-panel printing available<\/li>\n<li>Product descriptions and instructions printed directly<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you want an elegant <strong>rectangle box with lid for gifts<\/strong> or industrial-strength boxes for shipping, our team helps bring your concept to life.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Order Cardboard Boxes With Lid in Bulk for Cost Savings<\/h2>\n<h3>Why Businesses Choose Bulk Orders<\/h3>\n<p>Placing large orders of <strong>cardboard boxes with lid wholesale<\/strong> saves time, lowers cost, and guarantees consistency across product packaging.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Consistent box quality for all units<\/li>\n<li>Fast reordering with saved templates<\/li>\n<li>Cost-effective pricing per unit in higher quantities<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Our wholesale program is ideal for retailers, subscription box companies, warehouse managers, and shipping centers looking to streamline their packaging process.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Boxes for Specific Uses<\/h2>\n<p>If you\u2019re searching for boxes built for niche requirements\u2014such as food-safe packaging, document storage, or mailing kits\u2014you can visit our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses\/\"><strong>Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/strong><\/a> category. This section is organized to help you find packaging solutions by purpose and usage scenario.<\/p>\n<p>You\u2019ll find boxes suitable for apparel, electronics, event giveaways, shipping documents, and more.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom cardboard boxes with lid in any shape or size<\/li>\n<li>Durable materials for storage, gifting, and transit<\/li>\n<li>High-quality print and finishing options<\/li>\n<li>Coating styles: Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/li>\n<li>Free design support and mock-up previews<\/li>\n<li>Quick production timelines and nationwide delivery<\/li>\n<li>Low MOQs and bulk discounts available<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Contact us today for a quote and get started with your custom Cardboard Boxes With Lid at Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Looking for strong, eye-catching boxes to showcase your products? Our cardboard boxes with lids are exactly what you need. Made from high-quality materials, they&#8217;re durable and can withstand rough handling. Get premium printing options for a professional finish that will set your packaging apart. Contact us today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2378,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2244","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Get Custom Cardboard Boxes With Lid, Wholesale Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"High-quality cardboard boxes with lids, perfect for packaging your products. Choose from a wide range of sizes, styles, and finishes. Order now.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-lid\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Get Custom Cardboard Boxes With Lid, Who